    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d337-a4">

                <pb facs="0791" n="743" sameAs="frus:frus1868p1/pg743"/>

                <head>Mr. Van Valkenburgh to Commander S. P. Carter.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Legation of the United States in
                                Japan</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic">Yokohama,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1868-05-11"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >May</hi> 11, 1868.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> At a conference held this day by the
                    representatives of all treaty powers now here, with Higashi Kuze Saki No Shosho
                    and Nabisima Hizen Jijiu, the commissioners for foreign affairs of his Majesty
                    the Mikado, at their request, and upon their taking upon his Majesty’s
                    government sole charge and protection of this town, it was unanimously agreed
                    that the soldiers and marines heretofore doing duty at the several posts within
                    the town should be withdrawn on the 12th instant, at four o’clock p. m.</p>
                <p>You will, therefore, please withdraw your marines from the post by them now
                    occupied, at the time above designated.</p>
                <p>I am, sir, your most obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>R. B. VAN VALKENBURGH, <hi rendition="#italic">Minister Resident of the
                            United States in Japan.</hi></signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Commander S. P. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Carter</hi>, <hi
                            rendition="#italic">Senior U. S. Naval Officer, Com’d’g U. S. Steamer
                            Monocacy.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
